00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.920
So without further
ado, some of you

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.450
that attended the
last talk probably

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:29.410
already saw this slide.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:32.580
I was walking past,
and I saw the yellow,

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.360
so I'm sorry for
using the same slide

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.901
if you've already
seen it once today.

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:37.300
But I want to just
basically ask,

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.008
can you put your hands
up in the audience

00:00:39.008 --> 00:00:42.400
if you're already doing
